# ── Make API call ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
@When "^triggers reference data sync$"
    Given build json request with body from current scenario as user 'maker@example.com'
    When post to path '/ops/refdata/sync'
    And attach the response body to the report

# ── Assertions ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
@Then "^the reference data sync should be accepted successfully$"
    Then response status code is '200'
    And response matches current scenario
